## Important Note

CareFlow uses entirely synthetic data for educational and demonstration purposes. Its metrics and findings do not represent actual hospital performance and should not be used for clinical decision-making.

## Project Goal

The goal of CareFlow is to demonstrate how healthcare data engineering, process mining, and interactive analytics can transform timestamped event logs into actionable insights about patient pathways and operational bottlenecks.
